{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:17 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:17 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:17 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcbd9fa7d0b8f657698aa68fca47f863/2026-10/A2_10.jpg\"/><p>重陽節加上周末長假，亦是新皇崗口岸開通後首個周末。《星島頭條》緊貼每日出入境狀況。</p><h2>10.17︱首個周六有逾13萬人次使用皇崗口岸</h2><p>入境處數字顯示，周六（10月17日）全日有逾13萬人次經皇崗口岸出入境，其中入境有55,703人次、出境有74,661人次。而各口岸累計全日有逾135萬人次出入境，出境人次達84萬。</p><img alt=\"新皇崗口岸10月13日開通。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14a1e60bbf61570f4d5f034587644523/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_070222491_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5921a59881652765417b6ca858aabd2b/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_02_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0269769910ab72c6c00f8d3d47bca9ba/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c29db8177dc8bd47812eb18a10bd04bf/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_08.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/defb5045faeae4f9ac59584fde977b6e/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261012_074933438_09.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:39:21.952343+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:17:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T04:57:36.487408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:12.369214+00:00","content_hash":"60f0dd3bda0db200d5063552b85b62fe23c36d0190f0a4863eab22f25bfa9347","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}